{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19136","headline":"送宗密上人归南山草堂寺因谒河南尹白侍郎 · 刘禹锡","name":"送宗密上人归南山草堂寺因谒河南尹白侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿习修来得慧根，多闻第一却忘言。\n自从七祖传心印，不要三乘入便门。\n东泛沧江寻古迹，西归紫阁出尘喧。\n河南白尹大檀越，好把真经相对翻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}